These are the tabular Helmholtz EOS routines and table from
starkiller-astro/Microphysics (https://github.com/starkiller-astro/Microphysics).
The routines have been slightly tweaked to interface with standalone-XNet with
minimal dependencies. This Helmholtz implementation interpolates a tabulated
free energy and is distinct from the direct Timmes EOS. The tracked
helm_table.dat is byte-for-byte identical to the table distributed in
https://cococubed.com/codes/eos/helmholtz.tbz.
